{"data":{"id":7412,"name":"UniLend","symbol":"UFT","slug":"unilend","category":"token","description":"## What Is UniLend (UFT)?\n\nAn AI x Blockchain protocol shaping the future of Web3. Enabling communities to create and co-own functional on-chain AI agents, also the first-ever permissionless money market.\n\nUFT is the native utility token:\n\n1. Governance: UFT empowers users with governance rights, allowing them to shape the future of the UniLend products suite. Through active participation in voting and decision-making, UFT holders play a vital role in the evolution of decentralized finance, fostering a community driven ecosystem.\n\n2. Access Key to AI Agent Hub: UFT serves as the key access token to the AI Agent Hub, unlocking features and enabling interaction with AI agents and modules.\n\n3. One Gas for all Blockchain transactions: UFT will become Universal Gas Token, eliminating the need to buy or store multiple gas tokens. With $UFT, blockchain transactions, including cross-chain transfers, are simplified and free from market fluctuations, offering seamless, hassle-free movement across blockchains and enhancing the user experience.\n\n4. Token payments for Dapp on other blockchains:  Similar to gas fees, users can utilize UFT to make token payments for accessing any dApps on supported chains with a single unified payment. Say goodbye to the fuss of managing different tokens and enjoy seamless transactions with UFT.\n\n5. Incentives: It serves as a reward system for those contributing liquidity and engaging in our ecosystem's growth.\n\n6. Platform Benefits: Holding UFT unlocks exclusive advantages, including priority access, reduced fees, and enhanced yields within specific pools.\n\n\n## UniLend Products\n\n1. [UniLend V2](https://v2.unilend.finance) : UniLend is pioneering DeFi with the world's first permissionless lending and borrowing protocol, supporting all ERC20 tokens and enabling seamless lending and borrowing. Users can easily create dual-asset pools for any asset pair with price feed oracles and gas optimization. Key features include Isolated Dual Asset Pools, NFT Tokenization, Concentrated Liquidation, Flash Loans & more. [Read more](https://medium.com/@unilend/unilend-v2-mainnet-now-live-on-ethereum-46614e52b8dd).\nBuilding on the success of UniLend V1, Flash Loans and lending are now live on Ethereum, Polygon, BSC, and Moonriver, with over $50 million in Flash Loans executed and 30+ tokens listed, including $WMATIC, $BNB, $WMOVR, and $WETH. UniLend V1's launch on Moonriver marked the first flash loan service on Kusama.\n\n2. [Numa Network](https://app.numa.network/):  UniLend’s launched its latest innovation, Numa Network, a groundbreaking innovation designed to redefine blockchain interactions and solve long-standing usability challenges. Numa Network brings together cutting-edge solutions like gasless transactions, intent-driven automation, and a universal account mechanism, offering a seamless, intuitive experience for both users and developers. Numa Network sets a new standard for blockchain usability, making decentralized applications faster, smarter, and easier to access. [Read more](https://bit.ly/414gahQ)\n\n3. AI Agent Hub: UniLend AI Agent Hub enables anyone to develop sophisticated AI agents using modular legos of AI agents and supporting modules, leveraging blockchain to store data and workflows through modular smart contracts. Its modular architecture allows users to enhance agents with additional capabilities via action modules, creating a complete ecosystem where developers can list agents and other modules to build actionable AI agents. \n\n\n## How Many UFT Tokens Are There in Circulation?\nAs of now, UniLend Finance token (UFT) has a fully unlocked total supply of 100,000,000 UFT. This means that all tokens are currently in circulation, with none remaining locked or reserved. [Read Tokenomics](https://buff.ly/3dbYwxM)\n\n\n## Who Are the Founders of UniLend?\nUniLend Finance was founded in 2020 by a visionary and experienced team of blockchain enthusiasts who are redefining the landscape:\n\nChandresh Aharwar – Co-founder & CEO\nFormer VP of Strategy and Marketing at Matic Network, Chandresh drove branding, marketing, and community growth, growing Matic's (Now known as Polygon) community to 100K+ and establishing 20+ regional communities. He also led exchange marketing, helping list MATIC on 30+ exchanges, and ran the successful Matic Mitra ambassador program. With his extensive leadership experience in marketing and strategy, particularly from one of the industry's most successful Binance Launchpad projects, Chandresh’s expertise has been invaluable to UniLend’s ongoing success.\n\nSuryansh Kumar – Co-founder & CTO\nSuryansh is a serial entrepreneur with a successful career in blockchain and wider tech, having previously co-founded Flicat, OBTrack,OpenBracket and open-source blockchain metatransaction protocol Meta Transact.\nIn addition to his exceptional programming skills, Suryansh has an excellent mind for business strategy which has proven extremely valuable in the success of UniLend.\n\nTarun Malik – Co-founder & CPO\nTarun is highly educated, holding a Bachelor of Technology in IT from Guru Gobind Singh Indraprastha University and dual master's degrees in International Business and Information Systems from the University of Melbourne. Passionate about blockchain, he co-founded and grew IT services company 4 Way Technologies into a highly successful multi-million-dollar business with over 100% year-on-year growth. With experience as a Blockchain Consultant for Wificoin and co-founding Meta Transact, Tarun’s highly valuable expertise in business analysis, project management, and consulting has been essential to UniLend’s success.\n\nTogether, they’ve blended their diverse expertise to make UniLend a force to reckon with in the blockchain space.\n\n## Where Can I Buy UFT?\n\nUFT is a highly liquid asset available for trading on major CEXs and DEXs exchanges like [Binance](https://www.binance.com/en/trade/UFT_USDT), [HTX Global](https://www.htx.com/en-us/exchange/uft_usdt), [Uniswap](https://coinmarketcap.com/dexscan/ethereum/0x99dfde431b40321a35deb6aeb55cf338ddd6eccd/), [MEXC](https://www.mexc.com/exchange/UFT_USDT), [Gate.io](https://www.gate.io/trade/UFT_USDT?ref=12312805) and more.  \n","dateAdded":"2020-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","actualTimeStart":"2020-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","status":"untracked","isBn":0,"notice":"UniLend Finance (UFT) has rebranded to Maxi (MAXI) and migrated from its old contract address to the new one. Visit the Maxi page [here](https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/maxi) and refer to the official [post](https://x.com/MaxiFamilyHQ/status/2097033526143266939?s=20) for more details.","alertType":2,"alertLink":"","latestUpdateTime":"2026-07-11T00:08:00.000Z","watchCount":"23799","watchListRanking":-1,"dateLaunched":"2020-08-16T00:00:00.000Z","latestAdded":false,"launchPrice":0.15,"tags":[{"slug":"defi","name":"DeFi","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"lending-borowing","name":"Lending & Borrowing","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"exnetwork-capital-portfolio","name":"Exnetwork Capital Portfolio","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"fantom-ecosystem","name":"Fantom Ecosystem","category":"PLATFORM","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"injective-ecosystem","name":"Injective Ecosystem","category":"PLATFORM","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"dwf-labs-portfolio","name":"DWF Labs Portfolio","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3}],"selfReportedTags":["DeFi","Launchpad","Web3","AI Agents"],"selfReportedCirculatingSupply":"62330000.00","urls":{"website":["https://unilend.finance/"],"technical_doc":["https://unilend.gitbook.io/unilend-finance/whitepaper"],"explorer":["https://etherscan.io/token/0x0202Be363B8a4820f3F4DE7FaF5224fF05943AB1","https://ethplorer.io/address/0x0202Be363B8a4820f3F4DE7FaF5224fF05943AB1"],"source_code":[],"messa